history: Can you share the team calendar with me?
--- html
<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">I shared the calendar with you, you should see it in a minute.</div><div class="protonmail_quote">On Tuesday, November 10th, 2026 at 11:02, Fanny Roux &lt;fanny@example.fr&gt; wrote:<br><blockquote class="protonmail_quote" type="cite">Can you share the team calendar with me?</blockquote></div>
